    "body": "This has some edge cases which you'd need to avoid:\n* Skip playing sources with audio to avoid audible glitches.\n* Skip non-seekable sources (anything served w/ range requests)\n\nOpen questions:\n* What happens with sources that aren't time aligned?\n* How dynamic do you want this to be? I.e., 100ms, 1s response time? Rapid creation of hardware decoders can be problematic on some platforms. \n\nThe media element has the knowledge to make these decisions, so it seems possible to implement.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
